  "youtube": {
    "title": "Dopamine Is Lying To You.",
    "description": "He used to read a book a week. Now he can't finish a page.\n\nA short animated story about dopamine and your phone. Dopamine isn't really pleasure: it's the chase, the \"maybe the next one\". Neuroscientists describe it as being more about wanting than liking. Endless feeds never run out of next ones, so slow, real things start to feel boring.\n\nIf this is you right now:\n• Make the fast stuff harder to reach: phone in another room, apps off the home screen.\n• Expect the first days to be boring. The boredom is the point; it fades.\n• Pick one slow thing (a book, a walk, a real conversation) and give it 20 minutes a day.\n\nBoredom is where your life comes back.\n\nIf this helped, share it with someone who needs it, and subscribe for more.\n\n#dopamine #selfimprovement #screentime #focus #discipline #animation #motivation",
